/*
  SessionList.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0222 · SessionList (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  SessionList resolves (table "SessionList") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/system/components/chatbot/SessionList.tsx). The remainder back the native
  state envelope (relative-time subtitle pieces, freshness chip, connectivity banner,
  error chrome) and the accessibility strings.
*/

